std_msgs/Header header
string serial_number # Optional, specify to make sure only the desired radar gets the range changed, ignoring header.frame_id
int8 target_range    # As one of the constants declared in radar_info.msg
---
int8 actual_range        # The radar's current range after the request. When set successfully, same as target_range. Otherwise, another current radar range constant.
bool success             # true when the radar reached target_range, false otherwise (unsupported range, timeout, ...)
string error_message     # Empty on success, otherwise a human-readable reason the range wasn't set
int8[] supported_ranges  # Ranges supported by the radar (as radar_info.msg constants). Populated by the DDS API on a full round-trip; may be empty when the request is served from cache (already at the target range) or times out, and always empty for the UDP API (which doesn't expose it).
